{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>תר נערה.</b> Like עת (time), and some say it is from the root תור, for he comes at an appointed time, in the sense of וקול התור." "<b>מקץ היות לה.</b> The end, like מקץ שבע שנים, at the beginning." "<b>שמן המר.</b> A choice fragrance, and concerning it there is disagreement."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:46.780497455Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}